    <string name="permission_title">Access to your files</string>
    <string name="permission_rationale">Khizana needs the “All files access” permission for one purpose: finding your book files (PDF and CBZ) wherever they are on this device and opening them directly. The app has no internet permission, so nothing ever leaves your device. Note: Android itself blocks access to Android/data and Android/obb — no app can read them.</string>
