    <string name="backup_title">Backup &amp; restore</string>
    <string name="backup_desc">Saves your shelves, tags, reading positions and hidden flags to a JSON file. Restoring re-attaches everything by content fingerprint — even on a new device, after a scan. Android’s own cloud backup is switched off, so this file is the only copy of your library data that ever leaves the app.</string>
